# GraphKV ignore file
#
# Agents may append repo-specific generated, vendored, dependency, fixture,
# cache, or build-output folders before running `.opencode/scripts/build-graphkv`.
# Keep patterns repo-relative. Directory patterns should end with `/`.
# Glob patterns are supported, and `!pattern` can re-include after a previous match.
#
# Good candidates to append when present:
# - generated SDKs or API clients
# - checked-out dependency source trees
# - benchmark corpora, fixtures, model files, and large data dumps
# - build products, coverage output, cache folders, and vendored frontend packages

